calls.requirements:
1. Eligible applicants
1.1. Bulgarian private cultural organizations within the meaning of Art. 10, para. 1 of the ZZRK;
1.2. Organizations registered under the Law on People’s Community Centers;
1.3. Natural persons with Bulgarian citizenship or the right to reside in Bulgaria.

2. Ineligible applicants
2.1. Persons and organizations sanctioned under Art. 37 of the ZZRK and/or the application conditions under the respective procedure for a period of up to two years from the imposition of the sanction;
2.2. Persons and organizations in which a member of a management or control body, as well as a person temporarily performing such a position, including a procurator or commercial attorney, is a related person within the meaning of § 1, item 9 of the additional provisions of the Anti-Corruption Act with the executive director or with members of the management board;
2.3. Persons and organizations that have not submitted a report within the deadline under a contract for the provision of funds from the Fund or against which there is a court dispute regarding the performance of a contract financed by the Fund;
2.4. Projects that were not approved in previous competitions organized by the Fund, excluding projects that were not approved due to a shortage of the funds specified in the order for the respective competition;
2.5. Persons and organizations, donors to the Fund;
2.6. Employees of the Fund;
2.7. Members of the expert commission only for competitions for which they are assigned to participate in the respective commissions under the procedure of this ordinance;
2.8. Persons and organizations with two concluded contracts for the provision of funds from the Fund during the same calendar year;
2.9. Legal entities that are bankrupt or are in bankruptcy proceedings, or in liquidation proceedings;
2.10. Other persons restricted under the regime applicable to the competition, in accordance with the rules in the field of state aid;
2.11. Persons who have due public obligations, with the exception of obligations under acts that have not entered into force, as well as deferred, postponed or secured obligations.
